[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Drain the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584133\">0010T84</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584419\">1060G90</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584382\">1016B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Remove the valve rocker arms.</p><p>2. Remove the hydraulic tappets.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065696.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Lubricate with engine oil and refit the\nhydraulic tappets in their seatings.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Position the hydraulic tappets\nwith the oil passage hole facing towards the outside of the bottom\ncylinder head: this position puts this hole in communication with\nthe oil channel present in the bottom cylinder head.</p></aside><p>Place the valve rockers in their housings.</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584382\">1016B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584419\">1060G90</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Fill the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584133\">0010T84</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]